                "description": "The Osaka Lever with Square Rose is made out of solid stainless steel and is available in polished or satin stainless steel finishes. It is easy to install and will fit most standard predrilled doors that are 1-3/8 to 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Stainless Steel Osaka Lever with SE Rose has a return to door design that is compliant with California Fire Code.",
